        "quote": "} catch (error) { report.status = \"failed\"; report.error = String(error); process.exitCode = 1; }\nfinally {\n  await pipeline?.stop();\n  report.jobs = store.jobs.list(); report.refresh = store.db.prepare(\"SELECT * FROM refresh_records\").all();\n  report.proposals = new MemoryService(store).proposals(); report.finishedAt "
